                                                                                 )
                                                                   ] ;
                                               rdfs:label "HeritageEvent" ;
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Union of heritage event classes used for actor participation and temporal reasoning." ;
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/heritagegraph/ontology> .


