                                                       rdfs:label "SyncreticRelationship" ;
                                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Formalizes the syncretic equivalence between divine entities across different theological frameworks. Following CIDOC CRM E13, it treats syncretism as a propositional claim with associated epistemic authority and provenance." ;
